  "limits": [
    "Original AddrLib geometry and source-derived GFX9 descriptors execute on the CPU; this does not qualify GPU execution.",
    "The complete original AddrLib factory closure is linked; public admission is restricted to the selected Picasso GC9.1 profile.",
    "DCC/HTILE describe storage only. Unknown/compressed modifiers, compression transitions and pipe XOR remain unadmitted.",
